# Undo: history, barriers and same-batch crossings (#157).
#
# BOROUGH_LOG=1 godot --path src/Borough.Godot -- --empty --seed 0x135283C --citizens 2000 \
#   --drive scripts/ui/undo-gate.drive
#
# Six cases, all in open ground, each one a defect gate review round 1 found.
#
# A. An undo asked for while the gesture is still queued. It waits for the gesture to land and then
#    reverses that gesture, instead of reaching past it to the one before. Street 1 runs at north
#    160 and Street 2 at north 192; the hover at each point says which of them stands.
# B. Two Street gestures of one batch that cross. Neither can be reversed, because removing either
#    leaves the other in halves, so both refuse.
# C. The same thing at founding scale: two horizontals and three verticals on one Tick. Every undo
#    refuses rather than pulling a splitting Street out of the grid.
# D. A Street removed by Shift-click. The removal is a barrier: the undo refuses it and does not
#    reach the Street laid before it.
# E. A parcel stroke over unzoned ground, undone. The erase restores unzoned ground.
# F. A whole-block stroke over unzoned ground, undone.

256 pause
256 ui tools off
256 ui layers off
256 ui street-snap off
256 focus 32 200 900
256 tilt 50
256 speed 1

# A: Street 1 lands on its own Tick; Street 2 and the undo share Tick 258.
257 pause
257 hold street
257 click 0 160
257 click 128 160
257 speed 1
258 pause
258 hold street
258 click 0 192
258 click 128 192
258 ui undo
258 speed 1
# The hover at each Street names which one stands, so the readouts tell newest-first from
# oldest-first even in a headless run, where a draw list carries counts and no geometry.
259 pause
259 ui street-point 64 160
259 readout artifacts/undo/20-waited-at-first.txt
259 ui street-point 64 192
259 readout artifacts/undo/20-waited-at-second.txt
259 draw artifacts/undo/20-waited.tsv
259 speed 1
260 pause
260 ui street-point 64 160
260 readout artifacts/undo/21-done-at-first.txt
260 ui street-point 64 192
260 readout artifacts/undo/21-done-at-second.txt
260 draw artifacts/undo/21-waited-done.tsv
260 speed 1

# B: the crossing pair, both on Tick 261.
261 pause
261 hold street
261 click 0 224
261 click 128 224
261 click 64 208
261 click 64 244
261 speed 1
262 pause
262 draw artifacts/undo/22-crossed.tsv
262 ui undo
262 speed 1
263 pause
263 readout artifacts/undo/23-refused-batch-cross.txt
263 draw artifacts/undo/23-refused-batch-cross.tsv
263 speed 1

# C: a founding grid on one Tick, then two undos.
264 pause
264 ui street-length off
264 hold street
264 click 0 288
264 click 64 288
264 click 0 320
264 click 64 320
264 click 0 288
264 click 0 320
264 click 32 288
264 click 32 320
264 click 64 288
264 click 64 320
264 speed 1
265 pause
265 draw artifacts/undo/24-grid.tsv
265 ui undo
265 speed 1
266 pause
266 readout artifacts/undo/25-refused-grid.txt
266 ui undo
266 speed 1
267 pause
267 readout artifacts/undo/26-refused-grid-again.txt
267 draw artifacts/undo/26-refused-grid-again.tsv
267 speed 1

# D: two Streets, then the first removed by Shift-click.
268 pause
268 hold street
268 click 0 352
268 click 64 352
268 speed 1
269 pause
269 hold street
269 click 0 368
269 click 64 368
269 speed 1
270 pause
270 draw artifacts/undo/27-two-streets.tsv
270 hold street
270 click 32 352 shift
270 speed 1
271 pause
271 draw artifacts/undo/28-removed.tsv
271 ui undo
271 speed 1
272 pause
272 readout artifacts/undo/29-refused-removal.txt
272 draw artifacts/undo/29-refused-removal.tsv
272 speed 1

# Two lattice blocks of their own for the zoning cases.
273 pause
273 hold street
273 click 0 384
273 click 64 384
273 click 0 416
273 click 64 416
273 click 0 384
273 click 0 416
273 click 32 384
273 click 32 416
273 click 64 384
273 click 64 416
273 speed 1

# E: a parcel of unzoned ground painted for trade, then undone.
274 pause
274 ui zone-size parcels
274 hold zone 1
274 click 4 390
274 speed 1
275 pause
275 hold zone 1
275 ui zone-point 4 390
275 readout artifacts/undo/30-parcel-painted.txt
275 draw artifacts/undo/30-parcel-painted.tsv
275 ui undo
275 speed 1
276 pause
276 hold zone 1
276 ui zone-point 4 390
276 readout artifacts/undo/31-parcel-undone.txt
276 draw artifacts/undo/31-parcel-undone.tsv
276 speed 1

# F: the whole block beside it painted for housing, then undone.
277 pause
277 ui zone-size blocks
277 hold zone 0
277 ui zone-begin 36 390
277 ui zone-end 36 390
277 speed 1
278 pause
278 ui zone-point 36 390
278 readout artifacts/undo/32-block-painted.txt
278 draw artifacts/undo/32-block-painted.tsv
278 ui undo
278 speed 1
279 pause
279 ui zone-point 36 390
279 readout artifacts/undo/33-block-undone.txt
279 draw artifacts/undo/33-block-undone.tsv
279 speed 1
280 quit
